{"id":"6.8","doc":"T","title":"Pin Functions in Light-sleep","words":136,"blocks":[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":1,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Pins may provide different functions when ESP32-S3 is in Light-sleep mode."}]},{"n":2,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"If "},{"t":"field","v":"IO_MUX_SLP_SEL"},{"t":"text","v":" in register IO_MUX_"},{"t":"i","c":[{"t":"text","v":"n"}]},{"t":"text","v":"_REG for a GPIO pin is set to 1, a different set of bits will be used to control the pin when the chip is in Light-sleep mode."}]}]},{"t":"table","caption":"Table 6.8-1. Bits Used to Control IO MUX Functions in Light-sleep Mode","head":[[{"t":"text","v":"IO MUX Functions"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Normal Execution OR IO_MUX_SLP_SEL = 0"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Light-sleep Mode AND IO_MUX_SLP_SEL = 1"}]],"rows":[{"n":3,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"Output Drive Strength"}],[{"t":"field","v":"IO_MUX_FUN_DRV"}],[{"t":"field","v":"IO_MUX_MCU_DRV"}]]},{"n":4,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"Pull-up Resistor"}],[{"t":"field","v":"IO_MUX_FUN_WPU"}],[{"t":"field","v":"IO_MUX_MCU_WPU"}]]},{"n":5,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"Pull-down Resistor"}],[{"t":"field","v":"IO_MUX_FUN_WPD"}],[{"t":"field","v":"IO_MUX_MCU_WPD"}]]},{"n":6,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"Output Enable"}],[{"t":"text","v":"OEN_SEL from GPIO matrix *"}],[{"t":"field","v":"IO_MUX_MCU_OE"}]]}]},{"t":"p","s":[{"n":7,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Note:"}],"warn":true}]},{"t":"p","s":[{"n":8,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"If "},{"t":"field","v":"IO_MUX_SLP_SEL"},{"t":"text","v":" is set to 0, pin functions remain the same in both normal execution and Light-sleep mode."}]},{"n":9,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Please refer to "},{"t":"xref","id":"6.5.2","c":[{"t":"text","v":"Section 6.5.2"}]},{"t":"text","v":" for how to enable output in normal execution."}]}]}]}